    "name": "Ancient Shadows: Awakening",
    "steam_appid": 3829010,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient Shadows: Awakening</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the darkness, where every move could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient Shadows: Awakening is a fully 3D dungeon RPG set in a forgotten underground world filled with traps, puzzles, monsters, and magic. Explore handcrafted locations, collect gear, improve your skills, and uncover fragments of long-lost history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use real-time combat and tactical positioning to survive in ever more dangerous depths. Will you survive long enough to escape the darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully 3D underground world with atmospheric lighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time combat system focused on movement and reaction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles, traps, and interactive environments that challenge your attention</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory, crafting, equipment, and skill progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bestiary with unlockable information about discovered enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map with dynamic exploration of visited areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save system and the ability to continue your adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival elements: manage hunger, thirst, and poison; maintain your light source by refilling your oil lamp; and use campfires to cook food</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Localization in multiple languages</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient Shadows: Awakening</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the darkness, where every move could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient Shadows: Awakening is a fully 3D dungeon RPG set in a forgotten underground world filled with traps, puzzles, monsters, and magic. Explore handcrafted locations, collect gear, improve your skills, and uncover fragments of long-lost history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use real-time combat and tactical positioning to survive in ever more dangerous depths. Will you survive long enough to escape the darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully 3D underground world with atmospheric lighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time combat system focused on movement and reaction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles, traps, and interactive environments that challenge your attention</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory, crafting, equipment, and skill progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bestiary with unlockable information about discovered enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map with dynamic exploration of visited areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save system and the ability to continue your adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival elements: manage hunger, thirst, and poison; maintain your light source by refilling your oil lamp; and use campfires to cook food</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Localization in multiple languages</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Ancient Shadows: Awakening is a dark 3D dungeon RPG where you explore ancient ruins, battle terrifying creatures, and uncover the secrets of the deep.",
